# Mic / STT is frozen

Online Google STT and offline Vosk are **done**. Do not change their logic when editing other parts of the app.

Leave these files alone unless the user explicitly asks to change mic/STT:

- `lib/services/stt_service.dart`
- `android/app/src/main/kotlin/com/example/flutter_application_1/SpeechCapture.kt`
- `android/app/src/main/kotlin/com/example/flutter_application_1/VoskOfflineEngine.kt`
- `android/app/src/main/kotlin/com/example/flutter_application_1/SpeechPackStore.kt`
- related STT wiring in `MainActivity.kt` (`com.taptalk/speech`)

Do not "improve", refactor, retune merge/lock/silence, or touch the Google listen path as a side effect of other work.
